2. Nanotechnology Research
FIB systems support nanoscale machining and characterization, offering applications in academic and industrial research.

3. Integrated Analytical Platforms
Further integration of ion-beam systems with electron microscopy and advanced analytical workflows can improve productivity and expand the range of supported applications.

